{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Overview]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;CUPLEX&quot; is a time-shift action puzzle game where you cooperate with &quot;your past self&quot; to reach the goal. With each turn, your &quot;past self&quot; multiplies. <br>You will utilize them effectively to solve complex and orderly puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Story]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the new virtual space, &quot;CUPLEX&quot;. This is a virtual space, where unlike traditional ones, all senses... including sight, hearing, smell, taste, and touch, are interconnected. The protagonist, &quot;Cube&quot; hacked into the &quot;Library&quot; within CUPLEX in search of specific information. As he progresses through the Library, the truth behind CUPLEX gradually unfolds. Will he be able to accomplish his mission in the end...?  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Features]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbA unique puzzle system utilizing &quot;time-shift action&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbA relaxed atmosphere with calming music and graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbNumerous gimmicks and a total of 36 stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMore than 10 hidden Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbA ranking system in order to compete with players around the world</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Here is...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2499100/925bec74d1b99051d7c1027acf4277370263de72.jpg"},{"name":"Pavements","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2499100/55926b364e6d78c86b7611e9421bd61ad5d0c4d7.jpg"},{"name":"Ruins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2499100/daf98972de4faea36501ab5bbd17a9315a5b0c8c.jpg"},{"name":"Factories","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2499100/1cb99ac18fd1045e4540e25a184f0d5290d8bcfc.jpg"},{"name":"Plumbing","path":"https